# Generated evaluation workspaces and their outputs.
#
# `run.mjs --prepare` writes iteration directories here: fixture copies,
# pack-context copies, transcripts, run.json, grade.json and the aggregated
# benchmark. They are machine-local run artifacts, not reviewed content,
# and some of them (transcripts) can be large.
#
# Commit a result deliberately by copying the figures into RESULTS.md, not
# by committing a runs directory wholesale.
runs/

# Harness self-check scratch directories.
.tmp-harness-check/

# The repository root ignores *.log, which would silently drop the captured
# log excerpt that the trace-diagnosis case depends on. Fixture evidence is
# reviewed content, not machine-local noise, so re-include it here.
!fixtures/**/*.log
